{
    "title": "Pampers Club - Rewards & Deals",
    "description": "Meet Pampers Club: the parenting app that helps new parents earn back with every diaper change. Use the app to catch rewards & deals on baby care products as well as to keep track of your baby\u2019s development! \r\n\r\n\r\nThe baby app that helps you earn back\r\n\r\nHundreds of thousands of parents love Pampers Club, and there\u2019s good reason for that: the savings, access to exclusive promotions, baby care content, and more. Best of all, it\u2019s free to use! \r\n\r\nJust as important, with the parenting app, new parents get the chance to earn Pampers Cash with each diaper code they scan, which they can use to redeem terrific Pampers rewards!\r\n\r\nHow does it work? Pampers Club is a loyalty program available via the app, which you can download for free in the Android store. To start earning Pampers Cash, use the app to scan codes on the inside of each diaper pack. \r\n\r\nWith enough Pampers Cash, you can earn rewards like free diapers*, wipes, coupons, and discounts. Let each diaper change work for you!\r\n\r\n\r\nWelcome to the Club!\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s a brief overview of what you\u2019ll be able to take advantage of when you join Pampers Club:\r\n\r\nSavings\r\n\u2022 Each diaper pack contains a code that you can scan to earn Pampers Cash!\r\n\r\nRewards\r\n\u2022 From free diapers*  to coupons and discounts, there are useful rewards waiting for you in our catalog. \r\n\r\nParenting Tools\r\n\u2022 What to expect in the first year and beyond? We\u2019ve got a library of interactive tools at your disposal to help you track your baby\u2019s progress.\r\n\r\nExpert-led Content\r\n\u2022 Looking for guidance on each baby milestone? That\u2019s what you\u2019ll find here.\r\n\r\n\r\nParenting tools for you and your baby\r\n\r\nAnother useful tool that you\u2019ll find in the Pampers Club app is our handy diaper size tracker. Using the correct diaper size can be a difference-maker when it comes to preventing leaks and blowouts. We want to help you find the exact right fit for your baby, and we know that it can be tricky to do that when your baby\u2019s growing so quickly. That\u2019s where our diaper size tracking tool can come in handy!\r\n\r\n\r\nYour Pampers Club parenting journey\r\n\r\nFrom pregnancy to newborn feeding to potty training and each baby milestone beyond, Pampers Club is here for you. In the app, you\u2019ll find all sorts of useful baby care and parenting content that\u2019s tailored to every step along the parenting journey\u2014whether you\u2019re a new parent or an experienced one!\r\n\r\nHere's a taste of what you can find in the app:\r\n\u2022 Childbirth Education\r\n\u2022 Baby Development\r\n\u2022 Milestone Checklist\r\n\u2022 Month-by-month tips\r\n\u2022 Diapering \r\n\u2022 Feeding\r\n\r\nThere\u2019s also fun stuff like baby quizzes, birthday facts, and personal stories from other parents. Plus, you\u2019ll find useful tools like a baby name generator and a growth chart calculator. \r\n\r\nNeed help with baby-shopping? When you\u2019re coming up with your baby essentials checklist, we\u2019ve got articles that can offer useful insight into a variety of products useful at any stage in your baby\u2019s progress, from pregnancy to the things you might ask for at your baby shower to the best gifts to tools that can help with your baby\u2019s sleep and beyond.\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re a first-time parent looking for advice on what to expect in the first year or an experienced parent who\u2019s been through it all, Pampers Club is with you through each step and diaper change!\r\n\r\n\r\nTerms and conditions\r\n\r\nLearn more about how Pampers Club works here:\r\nhttps://www.pampers.com/en-us/rewards\r\n\r\nBy joining, you agree to the terms and conditions which can be found here: https://www.pampers.com/en-us/rewards-terms-conditions\r\n\r\n\r\n*Redeem Pampers Cash for rewards towards Pampers products at participating retailers. Exclusions apply. See terms & conditions. Apple and Apple logo are trademarks of Apple Inc.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Meet Pampers Club: the parenting app that helps new parents earn back with every diaper change. Use the app to catch rewards &amp; deals on baby care products as well as to keep track of your baby\u2019s development! <br><br><br>The baby app that helps you earn back<br><br>Hundreds of thousands of parents love Pampers Club, and there\u2019s good reason for that: the savings, access to exclusive promotions, baby care content, and more. Best of all, it\u2019s free to use! <br><br>Just as important, with the parenting app, new parents get the chance to earn Pampers Cash with each diaper code they scan, which they can use to redeem terrific Pampers rewards!<br><br>How does it work? Pampers Club is a loyalty program available via the app, which you can download for free in the Android store. To start earning Pampers Cash, use the app to scan codes on the inside of each diaper pack. <br><br>With enough Pampers Cash, you can earn rewards like free diapers*, wipes, coupons, and discounts. Let each diaper change work for you!<br><br><br>Welcome to the Club!<br><br>Here\u2019s a brief overview of what you\u2019ll be able to take advantage of when you join Pampers Club:<br><br>Savings<br>\u2022 Each diaper pack contains a code that you can scan to earn Pampers Cash!<br><br>Rewards<br>\u2022 From free diapers*  to coupons and discounts, there are useful rewards waiting for you in our catalog. <br><br>Parenting Tools<br>\u2022 What to expect in the first year and beyond? We\u2019ve got a library of interactive tools at your disposal to help you track your baby\u2019s progress.<br><br>Expert-led Content<br>\u2022 Looking for guidance on each baby milestone? That\u2019s what you\u2019ll find here.<br><br><br>Parenting tools for you and your baby<br><br>Another useful tool that you\u2019ll find in the Pampers Club app is our handy diaper size tracker. Using the correct diaper size can be a difference-maker when it comes to preventing leaks and blowouts. We want to help you find the exact right fit for your baby, and we know that it can be tricky to do that when your baby\u2019s growing so quickly. That\u2019s where our diaper size tracking tool can come in handy!<br><br><br>Your Pampers Club parenting journey<br><br>From pregnancy to newborn feeding to potty training and each baby milestone beyond, Pampers Club is here for you. In the app, you\u2019ll find all sorts of useful baby care and parenting content that\u2019s tailored to every step along the parenting journey\u2014whether you\u2019re a new parent or an experienced one!<br><br>Here&#39;s a taste of what you can find in the app:<br>\u2022 Childbirth Education<br>\u2022 Baby Development<br>\u2022 Milestone Checklist<br>\u2022 Month-by-month tips<br>\u2022 Diapering <br>\u2022 Feeding<br><br>There\u2019s also fun stuff like baby quizzes, birthday facts, and personal stories from other parents. Plus, you\u2019ll find useful tools like a baby name generator and a growth chart calculator. <br><br>Need help with baby-shopping? When you\u2019re coming up with your baby essentials checklist, we\u2019ve got articles that can offer useful insight into a variety of products useful at any stage in your baby\u2019s progress, from pregnancy to the things you might ask for at your baby shower to the best gifts to tools that can help with your baby\u2019s sleep and beyond.<br><br>Whether you\u2019re a first-time parent looking for advice on what to expect in the first year or an experienced parent who\u2019s been through it all, Pampers Club is with you through each step and diaper change!<br><br><br>Terms and conditions<br><br>Learn more about how Pampers Club works here:<br>https://www.pampers.com/en-us/rewards<br><br>By joining, you agree to the terms and conditions which can be found here: https://www.pampers.com/en-us/rewards-terms-conditions<br><br><br>*Redeem Pampers Cash for rewards towards Pampers products at participating retailers. Exclusions apply. See terms &amp; 